chapter.v:
and that 


if anyone, 


did not come within three days, by order of the officials and the elders all his property should be forfeited, and he himself banned from the congregation of the exiles.

Then the 


returned exiles, 


did so. Ezra the priest selected men,(3) heads of fathers’ houses, according to their fathers’ houses, each of them designated by name. On the first day of the tenth month they sat down to examine the matter;
